00:48:00.264 --> 00:48:03.408
You know, if you don't, uh, actually
go back and check pe- periodically,

00:48:03.446 --> 00:48:07.049
uh, check for those PDFs, uh, there
is a possibility, so the PDFs could

00:48:07.058 --> 00:48:11.822
be outdated or, you know, someone can
come in and manually change something,

00:48:11.851 --> 00:48:13.797
uh, in the PDF which is not accessible.

