So all of these are certain things that,
you know, could put your, uh, uh, website

00:48:18.861 --> 00:48:22.500
or your product into, um, you know,
in, in again, another risky situation.

00:48:22.661 --> 00:48:25.868
So it is just like maintaining your,
uh, websites or your HTML pages.

